OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain becomes
OL,6,Fwidespread and occasionally heavy this
OL,7,Fevening, clearing east overnight. Most
OL,8,Fareas will turn drier, though rain may
OL,9,Flinger over Buchan during the rest of
OL,10,Fthe night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FA risk of some early rain
OL,13,Fover Buchan. Otherwise a bright day
OL,14,Fwith some sunny spells in the morning
OL,15,Fthen showers developing in the
OL,16,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
