OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FRain
OL,6,Fclearing south Wednesday morning. Then
OL,7,Fnortherly winds developing bringing a
OL,8,Frather chilly feel with scattered
OL,9,Fshowers, some possibly heavy on
OL,10,FThursday and merging into a longer
OL,11,Fspell of rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
